{"model":"step35","text":"<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Atlas Operations Manual</title>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f4f6f8;--surface:#ffffff;--text:#1a1a1a;--muted:#5a6573;--accent:#005f99;--border:#cfd8dc;--focus:#ffbf47;--danger:#c62828;--success:#2e7d32;--warn:#f9a825}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml{scroll-behavior:smooth}\nbody{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);line-height:1.45}\nheader{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;background:var(--surface);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:0.75rem 1rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap}\nheader h1{font-size:1.25rem;margin:0;white-space:nowrap}\nheader .search{flex:1;min-width:200px}\nheader input[type=search]{width:100%;padding:0.5rem 0.6rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;font:inherit}\nheader .status{display:flex;gap:0.5rem;align-items:center;font-size:0.9rem}\n.badge{display:inline-block;padding:0.2rem 0.5rem;border-radius:4px;background:var(--muted);color:#fff;font-size:0.8rem}\n.badge.ok{background:var(--success)}\n.badge.warn{background:var(--warn)}\n.badge.err{background:var(--danger)}\n.sidebar{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;width:280px;background:var(--surface);border-right:1px solid var(--border);padding:1rem;overflow:auto;transform:translateX(-100%);transition:transform .2s;z-index:90}\n.sidebar.open{transform:translateX(0)}\n.sidebar nav a{display:block;padding:0.35rem 0;color:var(--text);text-decoration:none;font-size:0.95rem}\n.sidebar nav a:hover{text-decoration:underline}\nmain{margin-left:0;padding:1rem}\n@media(min-width:800px){.sidebar{transform:translateX(0)}main{margin-left:300px}}\nbutton{cursor:pointer;font:inherit}\nbutton:focus-visible,a:focus-visible,input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus);outline-offset:2px}\nh2{font-size:1.15rem;margin:1.5rem 0 0.25rem}\nsection{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:1rem;margin:1rem 0}\nsection>p{margin:0.4rem 0}\ndl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:0.25rem 1rem;margin:0.6rem 0}\ndt{font-weight:600}\ndd{margin:0}\ntable{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0.5rem 0;font-size:0.95rem}\nth,td{border:1px solid var(--border);padding:0.4rem 0.6rem;text-align:left}\nth{background:#eef1f5}\npre{background:#0f1419;color:#c9d1d9;padding:0.6rem;border-radius:4px;overflow:auto;font-size:0.9rem}\n.actions{display:flex;gap:0.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:0.5rem}\nbutton.primary{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:none;padding:0.5rem 0.8rem;border-radius:4px}\nbutton.secondary{background:#e3e8ee;color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:0.5rem 0.8rem;border-radius:4px}\n.toast{position:fixed;bottom:1rem;right:1rem;background:#222;color:#fff;padding:0.6rem 0.9rem;border-radius:4px;opacity:0;transition:opacity .2s;pointer-events:none;z-index:200}\n.toast.show{opacity:1}\n.skip{position:absolute;left:-9999px}\n.skip:focus{left:1rem;top:1rem;background:var(--surface);padding:0.5rem;border:1px solid var(--border);z-index:200}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<header>\n<button class=\"secondary\" id=\"menuBtn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"sidebar\">Menu</button>\n<h1>Atlas Operations Manual</h1>\n<div class=\"search\">\n<input type=\"search\" id=\"searchField\" placeholder=\"Search sections...\" aria-label=\"Search sections\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n<span class=\"badge ok\" id=\"sysStatus\">SYSTEM OK</span>\n<span class=\"badge\" id=\"secCount\">0 / 400</span>\n</div>\n</header>\n<aside class=\"sidebar\" id=\"sidebar\" aria-label=\"Section navigation\">\n<nav id=\"toc\"></nav>\n</aside>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section id=\"s0001\">\n<h2>1. Introduction and Scope</h2>\n<p>This manual defines operational parameters for the Atlas platform. Personnel must review applicable sections before performing maintenance or configuration tasks.</p>\n<p>Scope covers hardware, software, network, safety, and compliance. Each numbered section is authoritative and supersedes informal guidance.</p>\n<dl>\n<dt>Audience</dt><dd>Operators, engineers, auditors</dd>\n<dt>Revision</dt><dd>2025-11-10</dd>\n<dt>Classification</dt><dd>Internal Use</dd>\n<dt>Approval</dt><dd>Chief Systems Officer</dd>\n</dl>\n<table>\n<thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Value</th><th>Unit</th><th>Notes</th><th>Source</th><th>Review Date</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>Uptime target</td><td>99.95</td><td>%</td><td>Annual</td><td>SLA-01</td><td>2026-01-01</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Max latency</td><td>120</td><td>ms</td><td>P95</td><td>PERF-04</td><td>2025-12-01</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Backup interval</td><td>6</td><td>hours</td><td>Incremental</td><td>OPS-12</td><td>2025-11-15</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Patch window</td><td>02:00</td><td>UTC</td><td>Tuesday</td><td>CHG-07</td><td>2025-11-20</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Incident response</td><td>15</td><td>minutes</td><td>P1</td><td>INC-03</td><td>2025-12-10</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Capacity headroom</td><td>30</td><td>%</td><td>Sustained</td><td>CAP-09</td><td>2026-02-01</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<pre>atlasctl verify --all --strict</pre>\n<div class=\"actions\">\n<button class=\"primary\" data-action=\"ack\">Acknowledge</button>\n<button class=\"secondary\" data-action=\"print\">Print Section</button>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"s0002\">\n<h2>2. Terminology</h2>\n<p>Standardized terms ensure unambiguous communication. Terms defined here apply throughout this manual unless otherwise noted.</p>\n<p>When in doubt, consult the glossary appendix or query the terminology service.</p>\n<dl>\n<dt>Node</dt><dd>A single host in the cluster</dd>\n<dt>Shard</dt><dd>A partitioned data subset</dd>\n<dt>Quorum</dt><dd>Majority consensus for writes</dd>\n<dt>Replica</dt><dd>Readable copy of data</dd>\n</dl>\